= Transcaucasian Commissariat

Immediately following the seizure of power in Petrograd, the Tiflis Soviet issued a formal condemnation and declared it would not obey Sovnarkom directives. Dominated by Mensheviks and other moderate socialists, the major bodies of Transcaucasia have now declared the formation of a "Transcaucasian Commissariat", which will act as a provisional govenrment until the convocation of the Russian Constituent Assembly. Though hindered by sectarian conflict, it appears the Commissariat is positioning itself to become the government of an independent Trancaucasian federation, should relations with our government deteriorate further. 
  
